## Closest miss: context-proprioception → session-start headroom

This is the cycle's one genuine Gate-1 status change, and it was missed on
08-23. The 08-16 hold rested on two blockers: single attestation, and the
per-session token cost of an always-on injection. The first is now
resolved — `mason2026missing` was ingested 08-17, one day after that hold,
and is an independent *production* attestation (graduated pressure zones
measured over 857 Claude Code sessions) rather than a second benchmark.
Both sources are code-released (`binyxu/VISTA`, `fsgeek/pichay`) at
credibility 4 and 3, so **Gate 1 passes on two disjuncts**, not just the
3-attestation one.

It fails **Gate 2**, and the interesting part is that it fails on the new
evidence's own terms rather than on a generic complexity objection:

- `mason2026missing`'s **Normal zone (<60K tokens) deliberately tells the
  agent nothing**. The advisory fires at 60K specifically to leave ~40K of
  runway — "proprioception with no time to act on it is just a
  notification." So the one cheap form available here, printing `/headroom`
  from `hooks/session-start.sh` every session, is precisely the form this
  source argues against: it pays a fixed per-session cost to report a state
  that is almost always Normal.
- The graduated form it *does* argue for needs a live context-fill signal.
  Claude Code hook payloads do not carry one, so it would mean a new hook
  plus a new state channel — net-new surface area of the kind Gate 2
  defaults to rejecting.
- The unmet need is also narrower than the concept's framing suggests.
  `agency.md` already requires reading the coordinator verdict *before* an
  autonomous burst and re-checking inside long ones. That is perception
  delivered at the decision point, which is what VISTA's Theorem 1 actually
  asks for; the session-start banner would add perception where no decision
  is pending.

Recorded blocker changed from "not enough evidence" to **"no viable form
that does not add surface area."** If a future harness exposes context fill
to a hook, this becomes proposable immediately — the evidence side is done.

