  the same false-approval/false-rejection tradeoff that proposal attacks
  with a stricter re-test — and says to read it "before that proposal is
  implemented, not after." That is input to the review queue on an
  already-pending proposal, not a second proposal on `skills/elevate/`.
  Credibility 3, no code, single preprint; it would not clear Gate 1 on its
  own anyway.

